     <div class="nlh-idea__body"><span class="nlh-tag">Cadeau</span><h3>Un cadeau</h3><p>Un mot qui dure plus longtemps qu’un bouquet.</p><div class="nlh-idea__foot"><span class="nlh-mono">40 cm · <b>{{ prix_merci }}&nbsp;€</b></span><span class="nlh-idea__go">Créer <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div></div>
    </a>
    <a class="nlh-idea" href="{{ cfg }}?texte=Bienvenue&amp;police=pacifico&amp;couleur=glace&amp;largeur=50" aria-label="Une entrée : créer « Bienvenue » en bleu glace, 50 cm, {{ prix_bienvenue }} €">
     <div class="nlh-idea__img"><img src="{{ 'nlh-idea-bienvenue-720.webp' | asset_url }}" srcset="{{ 'nlh-idea-bienvenue-480.webp' | asset_url }} 480w, {{ 'nlh-idea-bienvenue-720.webp' | asset_url }} 720w" sizes="(min-width: 1000px) 380px, (min-width: 640px) 46vw, 78vw" width="720" height="540" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""></div>
     <div class="nlh-idea__body"><span class="nlh-tag">Maison</span><h3>Une entrée</h3><p>Le premier mot qu’on lit en arrivant.</p><div class="nlh-idea__foot"><span class="nlh-mono">50 cm · <b>{{ prix_bienvenue }}&nbsp;€</b></span><span class="nlh-idea__go">Créer <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></div></div>
    </a>
